&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;



Functionality&mdash; Allows for dimming capabilities to your Cocoweb lights
Precision&mdash; Provides up to 50 points of light intensity
Polished&mdash; Polished, metal knob provides an upscale look
Compatibility &mdash; Dimmer module is compatible with all Cocoweb Lighting products
Easy Installation &mdash; Plugs in directly to the Power Adapter cord



