Compare  For the  19" ClipOn Piano Lamp, this model is a new design that includes pre-installed LED Diode Bar. Older designs by other brand uses T10 traditional light bulb that may generate more heat and consume more energy.
LED Technology Cocoweb's  19" ClipOn Piano Lamp has a color temperature of 3,000K that resembles natural sunlight and is easy on the eyes. Cocoweb's LED technology gives piano lighting a leap in energy efficiency. The LED Lamp is pre-installed and included. The Cocoweb LED Diodes consumes less than half the electricity of traditional light bulbs, while providing ample illumination.&nbsp;
The ManufacturerCocoweb carefully crafts each light, using best available materials, to the highest quality standards. This quality lamp makes a stunning presence in any room and works well with many styles of decor. Cocoweb has been offering piano lighting known for its craftsmanship and quality. Cocoweb lamps are rolled, polished, buffed, sprayed and inspected for best quality.&nbsp;
Material Showcasing the classic lines of this lamp and cut from the highest quality solid brass, aluminum, and other materials, the GPLED19  features a matte powder-coated black finish. The coating ensures a lifetime of use, free from scratching and marring.&nbsp;
Fits Most PianosFeaturing an adjustable 3/8 - 1-1/2 mounting clip, this piano lamp fits on most piano music stands. Fits most pianos made by Boston, Bosendorfer, Baldwin, Fazioli, Steinway, Yamaha, Suzuki, Roland, Kawai, Casio and other piano brands.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS

Power Source: Plug- in adapter Material: Aluminum Bulb: Pre-installed LEDs Color Temperature (K): 2700Brightness (Lumens): 480CRI: &gt;90 Dimmable: Optional, not included Switch: In-line on/off toggle Lighting: adjustable directional Lifespan (Hrs): 50,000 Power Cord: 10-foot; Black Shade: 19" x 7/8" diameter Lamp Height: 9" Mounting clip: 5-1/2" x 2-1/2" x 3/8 - 1-1/2"" adjustable opening
