Showcase Your Masterpiece in the Best Light
Add a touch of refined elegance to your artwork with our Picture Light in Mahogany Bronze. The warm, polished finish brings a timeless charm that blends seamlessly with both classic and modern interiors. Ideal for highlighting artwork in living rooms, galleries, or stylish offices, the Mahogany Bronze finish provides a subtle yet sophisticated glow. With adjustable lighting, your art will be beautifully showcased, creating an inviting atmosphere that enhances the beauty of any space.
From Darkness to Light, Slide Right




&nbsp;




Pre-installed LED array
One of the key advantages of the Tru-Slim collection is its high-quality LED technology, delivering a bright, warm-white light with a soft orange/yellow hue at 2700 Kelvin. The preinstalled LEDs have an impressive lifespan of around 50,000 hours&mdash;roughly 20 years of average use&mdash;eliminating the need for bulb replacements. Additionally, LEDs operate at a much cooler temperature, helping to protect your artwork by preventing fading or cracking that can occur from exposure to excessive heat.
Energy Efficient
Another advantage of LEDs is their energy efficiency. They consume significantly less wattage than traditional bulbs, reducing operating costs by approximately 75%, while still providing the same level of brightness as incandescent bulbs.




Adjustable Lighting
The Tru-Slim lights feature a 90&deg; rotating shade, enabling you to adjust the angle of the light and secure it in place with two adjustment screws on each side. The height can be easily adjusted using the channel clamps located behind the frame. Positioning the light higher will direct the beam at a steeper downward angle, making it ideal for illuminating taller paintings.



Available Power Options

 
Plug-in Adapter &amp; Dimmer
This versatile installation option features a smooth, step-free dimmer that allows you to easily adjust the brightness for the perfect lighting experience.





Plug-in Adapter &amp; Remote
Enjoy the convenience of easily plugging in your light while gaining the flexibility to control it remotely.



 





