Compact, Efficient, and Slick Design The conscious art aficionado must always be aware of the necessity of balanced picture lighting, that is, the correct amount of art lighting that complements artwork without oversaturating it. An overabundance of illumination degrades portraits with ultraviolet light, while the opposite leaves one&rsquo;s display in the dark, both literally and figuratively. Thus, to assuage the aesthetic, Cocoweb has created its Tru-Slim Picture Lights: artistically engineered, these art lights join a sophistication of design with advanced Picture-Perfect&trade; LED art lighting technology, a light that, in itself, is art.
 


 

