A Piece That Adorns Any Space A timeless design, the 12" Calla lamp shade in Black will accent any home or commercial space with its flared shape. The straight bar Cosmopolitan arm arranges the Black Calla shade into a wall sconce that complements its surroundings with added vibrance.

Our wall sconces are decorative light fixtures that illuminate without taking any floor space, making them a perfect addition to small areas like hallways and bathroom vanities. They also function well as task lighting or accent lighting fixtures. Place a wall sconce in your bedroom beside your headboard as a reading light or add one to a living room or lounge for ambient light and warmth. Truly designed with versatility in mind, the Calla Sconce with the Cosmopolitan Arm may be used to light your kitchen, bathroom, or any indoor space or to welcome guests by being placed outside by your front door.


